# @desc   From the Inbox tab, open a chat matching TARGET_CHAT in the LHN, type a message and send it. Triggers the ManualSendMessage Sentry span (Send press -> optimistic message fragment rendered). Assumes the user is signed in with at least one chat in the Inbox.
# @pre    id="BaseSidebarScreen"
# @pre    id="searchButton" || role="button" label="Search"
# @post   text="${EXPECTED_CHAT_TITLE}"
# @post   text="${MESSAGE}"
# @reset  .claude/skills/agent-device/flows/macros/return-to-inbox.ad
# @span   ManualSendMessage
# @param  MESSAGE Unique message text to send and verify in the opened chat.
# @param  TARGET_CHAT_LABEL Exact accessible label of the report/chat row to open from the Inbox LHN.
# @param  EXPECTED_CHAT_TITLE Visible report/chat title expected after navigation.

is exists "id=\"BaseSidebarScreen\""
is exists "id=\"searchButton\" || role=\"button\" label=\"Search\""
press "role=\"tab\" label=\"Inbox. Your review is required\" || role=\"tab\" label=\"Inbox\" || label=\"Inbox. Your review is required\" hittable=true || label=\"Inbox\" hittable=true"
press "role=\"button\" label=\"${TARGET_CHAT_LABEL}\" || label=\"${TARGET_CHAT_LABEL}\" hittable=true"
wait text "${EXPECTED_CHAT_TITLE}" 10000
wait "id=\"composer\"" 10000
fill "id=\"composer\"" "${MESSAGE}"
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Send\" || label=\"Send\" hittable=true"
wait text "${MESSAGE}" 10000
is exists "text=\"${EXPECTED_CHAT_TITLE}\""
